{"term": {"label": "義", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-i", "title": "離婁上", "description": "孟子曰：「離婁之明，公輸子之巧，不以規矩，不能成方員：師曠之聰，不以六律，不能正五音；堯舜之道，不以仁政，不能平治天下。今有仁心仁聞而民不被其澤，不可法於後世者，不行先王之道也。\n「故曰，徒善不足以為政，徒法不能以自行。《詩》云：『不愆不忘，率由舊章。』遵先王之法而過者，未之有也。聖人既竭目力焉，繼之以規矩準繩，以為方", "occurrences": 8, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "安", "id": "安"}, {"form": "實", "id": "實"}, {"form": "居", "id": "居"}, {"form": "從", "id": "從"}, {"form": "教", "id": "敎"}, {"form": "正", "id": "正"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}, {"form": "身", "id": "身"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.7454377331738304, "source": "君子", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 3.9982007016691985, "source": "君子", "target": "子"}, {"weight": 3.305053521109253, "source": "君子", "target": "敎"}, {"weight": 0.9536782639457755, "source": "義", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 1.4926747646784624, "source": "義", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.052290552613885, "source": "義", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.4926747646784624, "source": "義", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 0.34754246037545977, "source": "義", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.7454377331738304, "source": "義", "target": "居"}, {"weight": 0.9536782639457755, "source": "義", "target": "身"}, {"weight": 0.4428526401797847, "source": "義", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.2413603363975563, "source": "義", "target": "正"}, {"weight": 1.8291470012996753, "source": "義", "target": "實"}, {"weight": 2.7454377331738304, "source": "義", "target": "從"}, {"weight": 0.7023638356648694, "source": "身", "target": "正"}, {"weight": 2.2064412324411435, "source": "身", "target": "居"}, {"weight": 1.1078289437730338, "source": "身", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 0.9536782639457755, "source": "君", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 1.0406896409354052, "source": 